# PRD: Billing area

## Problem
Finance staff rebuild invoice lists by hand in spreadsheets every month.

## Users
Finance staff and organization admins.

## Requirements
- R1: Users can see all invoices of their own organization, never another organization's.
- R2: Only admins can void an invoice.
- R3: Exports include the organization's invoices from the last 12 months (changed by the product owner on 2026-10-21 to match TICKET-12).
- R4: Invoice totals are shown in the organization's currency.

## Non-goals
- Payments collection in this phase.
# Backlog: Billing area

| Order | Slice ID | Intent | Status |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | SL-1 | Org-scoped invoice list | DONE |
| 2 | SL-2 | CSV export of invoices | BLOCKED on a design decision: delivery mode (intake LED-2026-10-25-export-design; old branch abandoned) |
| 3 | SL-3 | Admin-only void action in the UI | PLANNED |
import http from "node:http";
import { listInvoices, invoiceTotal } from "./invoices.js";

const invoices = [];

const server = http.createServer((req, res) => {
  const url = new URL(req.url, "http://localhost");
  if (req.method === "GET" && url.pathname === "/invoices") {
    const orgId = req.headers["x-org-id"];
    if (!orgId) {
      res.writeHead(401).end();
      return;
    }
    const rows = listInvoices(invoices, { orgId }).map((i) => ({ ...i, totalCents: invoiceTotal(i) }));
    res.writeHead(200, { "content-type": "application/json" }).end(JSON.stringify(rows));
    return;
  }
  res.writeHead(404).end();
});

if (process.argv[1] && process.argv[1].endsWith("server.js")) {
  server.listen(process.env.PORT || 3000);
}

export default server;

